  Id: station.nmc_wharf_pumps
  DisplayName: Wharf Pumps
  Flavor: 'Two hoses on a stand at the head of the Nine Mile Creek wharf, salt-bitten
    and slow. You lie alongside and fill without leaving the water - and you pay for
    the convenience, every litre of it. Anything past gas and diesel is a walk up
    the road.'
